# Whitelist approach: ignore everything by default, then allow only own files.
# This keeps the copyrighted CS:APP handout (mdriver.c, memlib.c, traces/, ...)
# and all build artifacts out of the repository.
*

# Allow subdirectories to be traversed (files inside are still ignored)
!*/

# Own files
!.gitignore
!mm.c

# Never commit build artifacts, even if whitelisted by accident
*.o
mdriver
*.out
gmon.out
